Original Statement:
------------------
SELECT 
  TPCDS.CATALOG_SALES.CS_SHIP_HDEMO_SK,
  TPCDS.DATE_DIM2.D_DOM 
FROM 
  TPCDS.CATALOG_SALES 
  INNER JOIN TPCDS.DATE_DIM2 
  ON TPCDS.DATE_DIM2.D_DATE_SK = TPCDS.CATALOG_SALES.CS_SHIP_DATE_SK 
WHERE 
  TPCDS.CATALOG_SALES.CS_EXT_SHIP_COST >= +00010.08 AND 
  TPCDS.CATALOG_SALES.CS_ITEM_SK >= 17521


Optimized Statement:
-------------------
SELECT 
  Q1.CS_SHIP_HDEMO_SK AS "CS_SHIP_HDEMO_SK",
  Q2.D_DOM AS "D_DOM" 
FROM 
  TPCDS.CATALOG_SALES AS Q1,
  TPCDS.DATE_DIM2 AS Q2 
WHERE 
  (Q2.D_DATE_SK = Q1.CS_SHIP_DATE_SK) AND 
  (17521 <= Q1.CS_ITEM_SK) AND 
  (+00010.08 <= Q1.CS_EXT_SHIP_COST)

Explain level:    Explain from section

